#: src/variantdescriptions.h:25
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Bohnenspiel is played on a board with 2 rows, each with 6 holes, and 2 end-"
"holes, called stores. Each player owns the store to their right hand and "
"controls the holes on their side of the board.\n"
"At the beginning, all holes are filled with 6 counters. The starting player "
"chooses one of the holes under their control and removes all counters in it. "
"The player goes through the holes next to the chosen one anticlockwise, "
"placing one counter in each one until they have no more counters in their "
"hand. Both stores are skipped. This is called sowing.\n"
"If the last counter falls into a hole, bringing the total number of counters "
"in the hole to 2, 4, or 6, these counters are captured and put in the "
"player's store. When a capture is made, the preceding hole is checked and "
"captured according to the same rule. The captures are repeated until the "
"previous hole has some number of counters other than 2, 4, or 6.\n"
"The game ends when a player cannot move anymore; the remaining seeds on the "
"board are given to the opposing player, and the winner is the one with more "
"seeds."
msgstr ""
"Bohnenspiel (alemanez, «babarrun-jokoa») 2 errenkadako taula batean jokatzen "
"da; errenkada bakoitzak 6 zulo ditu, eta muturretan beste 2 zulo daude, "
"biltegi deritzenak. Jokalari bakoitza bere eskuinean dagoen biltegiaren "
"jabea da, eta taulako bere aldeko zuloak kontrolatzen ditu.\n"
"Hasieran, zulo guztiak 6 haziz beteta daude. Hasten den jokalariak bere "
"kontrolpeko zuloetako bat aukeratu eta bertako hazi guztiak kentzen ditu. "
"Jokalaria aukeratutakoaren ondoko zuloetatik igarotzen da erlojuaren "
"orratzen aurkako noranzkoan, zulo bakoitzean hazi bana utziz, eskuan hazirik "
"gabe geratu arte. Bi biltegiak saltatzen dira. Ekintza horri ereitea "
"deritzo.\n"
"Azken hazia zulo batera erori eta zulo horretako hazi kopurua 2, 4 edo 6ra "
"iristen bada, hazi horiek harrapatu eta jokalariaren biltegian jartzen dira. "
"Haziak harrapatzen direnean, aurreko zuloa aztertzen da, eta arau beraren "
"arabera bertako haziak ere harrapatzen dira. Harrapaketak errepikatzen dira "
"aurreko zuloak 2, 4 edo 6 ez den hazi kopurua izan arte.\n"
"Jokoa jokalari batek jokaldirik egin ezin duenean amaitzen da; taulan "
"geratzen diren haziak aurkariari ematen zaizkio, eta hazi gehien duen "
"jokalaria da irabazlea."

#: src/variantdescriptions.h:48
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Oware is played on a board with 2 rows, each with 6 holes, and 2 end-holes, "
"called stores. Each player owns the store to their right hand and controls "
"the holes on their side of the board.\n"
"At the beginning, all holes are filled with 4 counters. The starting player "
"chooses one of the holes under their control and removes all counters in it. "
"The player goes through the holes next to the chosen one anticlockwise, "
"placing one counter in each one until they have no more counters in their "
"hand. Both stores are skipped and the starting hole is always left empty, so "
"it will also be skipped if there were 12 or more counters inside it. This is "
"called sowing.\n"
"If the last counter falls into a hole controlled by the opponent, bringing "
"the total number of counters in the hole to 2 or 3, these counters are "
"captured and put in the player's store. When a capture is made, the "
"preceding hole is checked and captured according to the same rule. The "
"captures are repeated until the previous hole does not belong to the "
"opponent or it has some number of counters other than 2 or 3. The only "
"exception to this is when a Grand Slam occurs. A Grand Slam is a move that "
"would capture all of the opponent's counters, and in this case no counters "
"are captured, as this would prevent the opponent from continuing the game.\n"
"This is related to a more general rule, that states that a player should "
"make moves that allow the opponent to continue playing. If the opponent's "
"holes are all empty, the player should make a move that places pebbles in "
"the opponent's side of the board. If no such move is possible, the current "
"player captures all seeds in their own territory, ending the game.\n"
"The game ends when a player has 25 or more counters in their store."
msgstr ""
"Oware (akaneraz, «ezkontzen da») 2 errenkadako taula batean jokatzen da; "
"errenkada bakoitzak 6 zulo ditu, eta muturretan beste 2 zulo daude, biltegi "
"deritzenak. Jokalari bakoitza bere eskuinean dagoen biltegiaren jabea da, "
"eta taulako bere aldeko zuloak kontrolatzen ditu.\n"
"Hasieran, zulo guztiak 4 haziz beteta daude. Hasten den jokalariak bere "
"kontrolpeko zuloetako bat aukeratu eta bertako hazi guztiak kentzen ditu. "
"Jokalaria aukeratutakoaren ondoko zuloetatik igarotzen da erlojuaren "
"orratzen aurkako noranzkoan, zulo bakoitzean hazi bana utziz, eskuan hazirik "
"gabe geratu arte. Bi biltegiak saltatzen dira, eta hasierako zuloa beti "
"hutsik uzten da; beraz, hasierako zuloan 12 hazi edo gehiago bazeuden, hura "
"ere saltatzen da. Ekintza horri ereitea deritzo.\n"
"Azken hazia aurkariak kontrolatutako zulo batera erortzen bada eta zulo "
"horretako hazi kopurua 2ra edo 3ra iristen bada, hazi horiek harrapatu eta "
"jokalariaren biltegian jartzen dira. Harrapaketa bat egiten denean, aurreko "
"zuloa aztertzen da, eta arau beraren arabera bertako haziak ere harrapatzen "
"dira. Harrapaketak aurreko zuloa aurkariarena izateari utzi arte edo 2 edo 3 "
"ez den hazi kopurua izan arte errepikatzen dira. Arau horrek salbuespen "
"bakarra du: Grand Slam bat gertatzen denean. Grand Slam aurkariaren hazi "
"guztiak harrapatuko lituzkeen jokaldia da; halakoetan ez da hazirik "
"harrapatzen, bestela aurkariak ezin izango bailuke jokatzen jarraitu.\n"
"Hori arau orokorrago batekin lotuta dago: jokalariak aurkariari jokatzen "
"jarraitzeko aukera ematen dioten jokaldiak egin behar ditu. Aurkariaren zulo "
"guztiak hutsik badaude, jokalariak aurkariaren taula-aldean haziak uzten "
"dituen jokaldi bat egin behar du. Horrelako jokaldirik egin ezin bada, uneko "
"jokalariak bere eremuko hazi guztiak harrapatzen ditu, eta jokoa amaitu "
"egiten da.\n"
"Jokoa jokalari batek bere biltegian 25 hazi edo gehiago dituenean amaitzen "
"da."

#: src/variantdescriptions.h:83
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Pallanguli is played with a rectangular board that has two rows and 7 pits "
"on each side, along with pebbles/coins.\n"
"To begin, each pit is filled with 6 coins (the number of coins varies). The "
"first player picks up coins from one of the pits and starts to drop them in "
"an anti-clockwise direction in each succeeding pit. If the player reaches "
"the last pit in the row, he/she continues on their opponent's side. Once the "
"last coin is dropped, the player takes the coin from the next pit and "
"continues playing in the same way. If the last coin falls into a pit where "
"the next pit is empty, the coins in the pit beyond the empty pit are "
"captured and stored by the player. The player continues playing from the "
"next cup containing coins. If the last coin falls into a pit with two empty "
"holes beyond, the player's turn comes to an end. The opponent now continues "
"to play in the same way, taking coins from any of their pits and going "
"around dropping the coins in a counter-clockwise direction. If, after "
"dropping a pebble into a pit, the pit contains four coins, these coins are "
"also captured by the player.\n"
"The round is over when no coins remain."
msgstr ""
"Pallanguli 2 errenkada eta alde bakoitzean 7 zulo dituen taula angeluzuzen "
"batean jokatzen da, harritxoak edo txanponak erabiliz.\n"
"Hasieran, zulo bakoitza 6 txanponez betetzen da (txanpon kopurua aldatu egin "
"daiteke). Lehen jokalariak zuloetako bateko txanponak hartzen ditu eta "
"erlojuaren orratzen aurkako noranzkoan haiek banatzen hasten da, hurrengo "
"zuloetako bakoitzean bana utziz. Jokalaria errenkadako azken zulora iristen "
"bada, aurkariaren aldean jarraitzen du. Azken txanpona utzi ondoren, "
"hurrengo zuloko txanponak hartu eta modu berean jokatzen jarraitzen du. "
"Azken txanpona zulo batean erortzen bada eta hurrengo zuloa hutsik badago, "
"zulo huts horren ondoko zuloko txanponak harrapatu eta gordetzen ditu. "
"Ondoren, txanponak dituen hurrengo zulotik jokatzen jarraitzen du. Azken "
"txanpona zulo batean erortzen bada eta haren ondoren bi zulo huts badaude, "
"jokalariaren txanda amaitzen da. Orduan aurkariak modu berean jarraitzen du: "
"bere zuloetako bateko txanponak hartu eta erlojuaren orratzen aurkako "
"noranzkoan banan-banan banatzen ditu. Txanpon bat zulo batean utzi ondoren "
"zulo horrek lau txanpon baditu, jokalariak txanpon horiek ere harrapatzen "
"ditu.\n"
"Txanponik geratzen ez denean erronda amaitzen da."

#: src/variantdescriptions.h:115
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Kalah is played on a board with 2 rows, each with 6 holes, and 2 end-holes, "
"called kalahs. Each player owns the store to their right hand and controls "
"the holes on their side of the board.\n"
"At the beginning, all holes are filled with 6 beans  and the kalahs are "
"empty. The starting player chooses one of the holes on their side and "
"removes all the beans in it. The player goes through the holes next to the "
"chosen one  anticlockwise, placing one bean in each one until they have no "
"more beans left. The opponent's kalah is skipped. This is called sowing. If "
"after sowing, the last bean falls in the player's kalah, the player must "
"move again. Otherwise, the move is over.\n"
"If the last bean falls into an empty hole controlled by the player and the "
"hole controlled by the opponent opposite to it has beans in it, then all the "
"beans in both the holes are removed and moved to the player's kalah. This is "
"called capturing.\n"
"The game ends when a player has more than 36 beans in their kalah."
msgstr ""
"Kalah 2 errenkadako taula batean jokatzen da; errenkada bakoitzak 6 zulo "
"ditu, eta muturretan beste 2 zulo daude, kalah deritzenak. Jokalari bakoitza "
"bere eskuinean dagoen kalah zuloaren jabea da, eta taulako bere aldeko "
"zuloak kontrolatzen ditu.\n"
"Hasieran, zulo guztiak 6 babarrunez beteta daude, eta kalah zuloak hutsik "
"daude. Hasten den jokalariak bere aldeko zuloetako bat aukeratu eta bertako "
"babarrun guztiak kentzen ditu. Jokalaria aukeratutakoaren ondoko zuloetatik "
"igarotzen da erlojuaren orratzen aurkako noranzkoan, zulo bakoitzean "
"babarrun bana utziz, eskuan babarrunik gabe geratu arte. Aurkariaren kalah "
"zuloa saltatzen da. Ekintza horri ereitea deritzo. Erein ondoren azken "
"babarruna jokalariaren kalah zuloan erortzen bada, jokalariak beste jokaldi "
"bat egin behar du. Bestela, jokaldia amaitzen da.\n"
"Azken babarruna jokalariak kontrolatutako zulo huts batera erortzen bada eta "
"aurrean dagoen aurkariaren zuloak babarrunak baditu, bi zuloetako babarrun "
"guztiak kendu eta jokalariaren kalah zulora eramaten dira. Ekintza horri "
"harrapatzea deritzo.\n"
"Jokoa jokalari batek bere kalah zuloan 36 babarrun baino gehiago dituenean "
"amaitzen da."

#: src/variantdescriptions.h:139
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Vamana Guntalu is a two-player game featuring 2 rows and 7 pits per row. The "
"board is prepared by filling each pit with 12 tamarind seeds or cowrie "
"shells, except for the middle pits (kaashis) which contain only 1 seed.\n"
"The player selects any pit from their row and sows the seeds clockwise or "
"counter-clockwise one by one. If sowing ends and the next pit is occupied, "
"the player scoops up those seeds to continue. If the next pit is empty, they "
"capture the seeds in the pit immediately following it. If a capture occurs "
"in the opponent's row, the player also takes the seeds from the pit directly "
"opposite it in their own row.\n"
"A player's turn ends if they must pick up seeds from a kaashi to continue. "
"Seeds in a kaashi can be captured but remain on the board as 'shared' "
"assets. Whenever a pit reaches exactly 4 seeds, those seeds are captured "
"instantly.\n"
"The round ends when only kaashis contain seeds. Players then attempt to "
"refill pits with 12 seeds from their winnings. Pits that cannot be fully "
"refilled become 'unplayable'. The game ends when a player cannot fill even a "
"single pit.and the loser is the one with fewer captured seeds."
msgstr ""
"Vamana Guntalu bi jokalarirentzako jokoa da; 2 errenkada ditu, eta errenkada "
"bakoitzak 7 zulo ditu. Taula prestatzeko, zulo bakoitza 12 tamarindo-haziz "
"edo kauri-maskorrez betetzen da, erdiko zuloak izan ezik; kaashi deritzen "
"diren zulo horiek hazi bakarra dute.\n"
"Jokalariak bere errenkadako edozein zulo hautatu eta haziak banan-banan "
"ereiten ditu, erlojuaren orratzen noranzkoan edo aurkakoan. Ereitea "
"amaitzean hurrengo zuloan haziak badaude, jokalariak hazi horiek hartu eta "
"ereiten jarraitzen du. Hurrengo zuloa hutsik badago, haren ondoko zuloko "
"haziak harrapatzen ditu. Harrapaketa aurkariaren errenkadan gertatzen bada, "
"jokalariak bere errenkadan aurrez aurre dagoen zuloko haziak ere hartzen "
"ditu.\n"
"Jokalariak jarraitzeko kaashi zulo bateko haziak hartu behar baditu, bere "
"txanda amaitzen da. Kaashi zulo bateko haziak harrapa daitezke, baina taulan "
"geratzen dira baliabide «partekatu» gisa. Zulo batek zehazki 4 hazi "
"dituenean, hazi horiek berehala harrapatzen dira.\n"
"Erronda haziak kaashi zuloetan bakarrik geratzen direnean amaitzen da. "
"Ondoren, jokalariak zuloak berriz 12 haziz betetzen saiatzen dira, "
"irabazitako haziak erabiliz. Guztiz bete ezin diren zuloak jokatu ezin diren "
"zulo bihurtzen dira. Jokoa jokalari batek zulo bakar bat ere bete ezin "
"duenean amaitzen da, eta harrapatutako hazi gutxien dituen jokalaria da "
"galtzailea."
